[h1]Probably MCM — Mod Configuration Menu[/h1]

Tired of editing config files in Notepad or guessing key codes?
[b]Probably MCM[/b] brings a clean, unified settings hub directly into [i]Probably Stolen[/i]. Configure all your favorite mods on the fly without restarts or hassle.

[b]GitHub Repository:[/b] [url=https://github.com/GafarovMaxim/Probably-MCM]https://github.com/GafarovMaxim/Probably-MCM[/url]
[b]Developer Guide:[/b] [url=https://github.com/GafarovMaxim/Probably-MCM/blob/main/Documentation.md]Documentation.md (EN & 中文)[/url]
[b]Author:[/b] Raul Moreau

